% Binary built-ins. TEXT converts to BIN through UTF-8 and nothing else.

### name: bin.blen
--- note
Six code points, ten UTF-8 bytes.
--- source
BLEN("Zażółć")
--- expect
num 10
===
### name: bin.to-utf8
--- source
TO_UTF8("ż")
--- expect
bin c5bc
===
### name: bin.from-utf8
--- source
FROM_UTF8(FROM_HEX("c5bc"))
--- expect
text "ż"
===
### name: bin.from-utf8.invalid
--- source
FROM_UTF8(FROM_HEX("c080"))
--- expect
error E_UTF8
===
### name: bin.from-utf8.surrogate-bytes
--- source
FROM_UTF8(FROM_HEX("eda080"))
--- expect
error E_UTF8
===
### name: bin.from-utf8.truncated
--- source
FROM_UTF8(FROM_HEX("c5"))
--- expect
error E_UTF8
===
### name: bin.to-hex
--- source
TO_HEX("AB")
--- expect
text "4142"
===
### name: bin.from-hex
--- source
FROM_HEX("4142")
--- expect
bin 4142
===
### name: bin.from-hex.uppercase
--- source
FROM_HEX("FF00")
--- expect
bin ff00
===
### name: bin.from-hex.odd-length
--- source
FROM_HEX("abc")
--- expect
error E_BAD_ARG
===
### name: bin.from-hex.not-hex
--- source
FROM_HEX("zz")
--- expect
error E_BAD_ARG
===
### name: bin.base64.encode
--- source
ENCODE_BASE64("hello")
--- expect
text "aGVsbG8="
===
### name: bin.base64.encode-two-pad
--- source
ENCODE_BASE64("a")
--- expect
text "YQ=="
===
### name: bin.base64.encode-empty
--- source
"[" & ENCODE_BASE64("") & "]"
--- expect
text "[]"
===
### name: bin.base64.roundtrip
--- source
FROM_UTF8(DECODE_BASE64(ENCODE_BASE64("Zażółć")))
--- expect
text "Zażółć"
===
### name: bin.base64.decode
--- source
DECODE_BASE64("aGVsbG8=")
--- expect
bin 68656c6c6f
===
### name: bin.base64.decode-bad-character
--- source
DECODE_BASE64("aGV_bG8=")
--- expect
error E_BAD_ARG
===
### name: bin.base64.decode-unpadded
--- source
DECODE_BASE64("aGVsbG8")
--- expect
error E_BAD_ARG
===
### name: bin.crc32
--- note
The check value of CRC-32/ISO-HDLC for "123456789".
--- source
CRC32("123456789")
--- expect
text "cbf43926"
===
### name: bin.crc32.empty
--- source
CRC32("")
--- expect
text "00000000"
===
### name: bin.crc32.utf8
--- source
CRC32("ż")
--- expect
text "3583ce53"
===
### name: bin.btl
--- source
BTL("AB")
--- expect
tree -{"1"=t"65", "2"=t"66"}
===
### name: bin.ltb
--- source
LTB((65, 66))
--- expect
bin 4142
===
### name: bin.ltb.out-of-range
--- source
LTB((65, 256))
--- expect
error E_RANGE
===
### name: bin.ltb.fractional
--- source
LTB((65, 1.5))
--- expect
error E_RANGE
===
### name: bin.roundtrip-btl-ltb
--- source
FROM_UTF8(LTB(BTL("Zażółć")))
--- expect
text "Zażółć"
===
